#: templates/emails/account_link.txt:1
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Hello %(first_name)s,\n"
"\n"
"An account has been created for you at %(company)s to record your working "
"time."
msgstr ""
"Hola %(first_name)s:\n"
"\n"
"S'ha creat un compte per a tu a %(company)s per registrar la teva jornada."

#: templates/emails/account_link.txt:4
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Hello %(first_name)s,\n"
"\n"
"Somebody asked to reset the password of your account at %(company)s."
msgstr ""
"Hola %(first_name)s:\n"
"\n"
"Algú ha demanat restablir la contrasenya del teu compte a %(company)s."

# revisar: traducido sin hablante nativo el 2026-08-27
#: templates/emails/account_link.txt:8
msgid "Open this link to set your password:"
msgstr "Obre aquest enllaç per posar la teva contrasenya:"

# revisar: traducido sin hablante nativo el 2026-08-27
#: templates/emails/account_link.txt:12
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The link works once and expires in %(hours)s hours.\n"
"\n"
"If it was not you, ignore this message: nothing changes until the link is "
"used."
msgstr ""
"L'enllaç funciona una vegada i caduca en %(hours)s hores.\n"
"\n"
"Si no has estat tu, ignora aquest missatge: no canvia res fins que no es "
"faci servir l'enllaç."

# revisar: traducido sin hablante nativo el 2026-08-27
#: templates/emails/punch_reminder.txt:1
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Hello %(first_name)s,\n"
"\n"
"You have a shift at %(company)s today and have not clocked in yet.\n"
"\n"
"Clock in when you can, so your working day is recorded at the real time."
msgstr ""
"Hola %(first_name)s,\n"
"\n"
"Avui tens un torn a %(company)s i encara no has fitxat l'entrada.\n"
"\n"
"Fitxa quan puguis, perquè la teva jornada quedi registrada a l'hora real."

# revisar: traducido sin hablante nativo el 2026-08-27
#: templates/emails/punch_reminder.txt:5
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Hello %(first_name)s,\n"
"\n"
"Your working day of %(day)s at %(company)s is still open: you clocked in and "
"not out.\n"
"\n"
"Clock out when you finish. The server sets the time from your punch, so it "
"is\n"
"recorded exactly as it happens, overtime included if you stay longer today."
msgstr ""
"Hola %(first_name)s,\n"
"\n"
"La teva jornada del %(day)s a %(company)s encara és oberta: has fitxat "
"l'entrada i no la sortida.\n"
"\n"
"Fitxa la sortida quan acabis. L'hora la posa el servidor a partir del teu "
"fitxatge,\n"
"així que queda registrada tal com passa, amb les hores extres incloses si "
"avui et quedes més estona."

# revisar: traducido sin hablante nativo el 2026-08-27
#: templates/emails/punch_reminder.txt:12
msgid ""
"This is only a reminder: nothing has been recorded for you. You can turn "
"these off in your profile."
msgstr ""
"Això només és un recordatori: no s'ha registrat res al teu nom. Els pots "
"desactivar al teu perfil."

# revisar: traducido sin hablante nativo el 2026-08-27
#: templates/emails/record_change_proposed.txt:1
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Hello %(first_name)s,\n"
"\n"
"Your employer, %(company)s, proposes a change to your working time record."
msgstr ""
"Hola %(first_name)s,\n"
"\n"
"La teva empresa, %(company)s, proposa un canvi al teu registre de jornada."

# revisar: traducido sin hablante nativo el 2026-08-27
#: templates/emails/record_change_proposed.txt:7
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Reason given: %(reason)s\n"
"Proposed by: %(proposed_by)s"
msgstr ""
"Motiu al·legat: %(reason)s\n"
"Proposat per: %(proposed_by)s"

# revisar: traducido sin hablante nativo el 2026-08-27
#: templates/emails/record_change_proposed.txt:10
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Nothing has changed yet. You can accept it, or say you do not agree ---\n"
"in which case your account is recorded beside the change and the workers' "
"legal\n"
"representation is informed.\n"
"\n"
"You have %(days)s days to answer. After that the company may apply the "
"change,\n"
"and it will be recorded as made without your agreement."
msgstr ""
"Encara no ha canviat res. Ho pots acceptar, o dir que no hi estàs d'acord "
"---\n"
"i aleshores la teva versió queda registrada al costat del canvi i s'informa "
"la\n"
"representació legal de les persones treballadores.\n"
"\n"
"Tens %(days)s dies per respondre. Passat aquest termini l'empresa pot "
"aplicar el canvi,\n"
"i quedarà registrat com a fet sense el teu acord."

# revisar: traducido sin hablante nativo el 2026-08-27
#: templates/emails/record_change_withdrawn.txt:1
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Hello %(first_name)s,\n"
"\n"
"Your employer, %(company)s, has withdrawn the change it proposed to your\n"
"working time record."
msgstr ""
"Hola %(first_name)s,\n"
"\n"
"La teva empresa, %(company)s, ha retirat el canvi que havia proposat al teu\n"
"registre de jornada."

# revisar: traducido sin hablante nativo el 2026-08-27
#: templates/emails/record_change_withdrawn.txt:8
#, python-format
msgid "Withdrawn by: %(withdrawn_by)s"
msgstr "Retirat per: %(withdrawn_by)s"

# revisar: traducido sin hablante nativo el 2026-08-27
#: templates/emails/record_change_withdrawn.txt:9
#, python-format
msgid "Reason given: %(note)s"
msgstr "Motiu al·legat: %(note)s"

# revisar: traducido sin hablante nativo el 2026-08-27
#: templates/emails/record_change_withdrawn.txt:11
msgid ""
"Your record has not changed, and there is nothing for you to\n"
"answer any more. The entry stayed exactly as it was."
msgstr ""
"El teu registre no ha canviat, i ja no has de respondre\n"
"res. L'assentament s'ha quedat exactament com era."

# revisar: traducido sin hablante nativo el 2026-08-27
#: templates/emails/record_changed.txt:1
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Hello %(first_name)s,\n"
"\n"
"Your working time record has been changed at %(company)s."
msgstr ""
"Hola %(first_name)s,\n"
"\n"
"El teu registre de jornada ha canviat a %(company)s."

# revisar: traducido sin hablante nativo el 2026-08-27
#: templates/emails/record_changed.txt:7
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Reason given: %(reason)s\n"
"Decided by: %(resolver)s on %(decided_on)s."
msgstr ""
"Motiu al·legat: %(reason)s\n"
"Decidit per: %(resolver)s el %(decided_on)s."

# revisar: traducido sin hablante nativo el 2026-08-27
#: templates/emails/record_changed.txt:10
msgid ""
"The previous version has not been deleted: both are kept in your\n"
"history, and you can download your full record at any time.\n"
"\n"
"If this does not match what happened, tell whoever manages your working time."
msgstr ""
"La versió anterior no s'ha esborrat: totes dues es conserven al teu\n"
"historial, i pots descarregar el teu registre complet quan vulguis.\n"
"\n"
"Si això no es correspon amb el que va passar, digues-ho a qui gestiona la "
"teva jornada."

#: templates/emails/record_delivery.txt:1
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Hello %(first_name)s,\n"
"\n"
"Here is the link to download your own working time record at %(company)s."
msgstr ""
"Hola %(first_name)s:\n"
"\n"
"Aquí tens l'enllaç per descarregar el teu propi registre de jornada a "
"%(company)s."

#: templates/emails/record_delivery.txt:7
#, python-format
msgid ""
"It expires in %(hours)s hours, and until then you can use it as many\n"
"times as you need --- the PDF and the spreadsheet are two downloads. If it "
"stops\n"
"working, ask %(company)s for another one."
msgstr ""
"Caduca en %(hours)s hores i fins aleshores el pots fer servir les vegades\n"
"que necessitis: el PDF i el full de càlcul són dues descàrregues. Si deixa\n"
"de funcionar, demana'n un altre a %(company)s."

#: templates/emails/record_delivery.txt:11
msgid ""
"What you get is the whole record still kept, which is at least the four\n"
"years the law requires. It does not open an account and it gives access to\n"
"nothing else."
msgstr ""
"El que reps és tot el registre que encara es conserva, que són com a mínim\n"
"els quatre anys que exigeix la llei. No obre cap compte i no dóna accés a\n"
"res més."

# revisar: traducido sin hablante nativo el 2026-08-27
#: templates/emails/representatives_informed.txt:1
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Hello,\n"
"\n"
"You are recorded as a workers' representative at %(company)s."
msgstr ""
"Hola,\n"
"\n"
"Constes com a representant de les persones treballadores a %(company)s."

# revisar: traducido sin hablante nativo el 2026-08-27
#: templates/emails/representatives_informed.txt:5
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(employee)s disagrees with a change the company proposes to their\n"
"working time record, dated %(day)s."
msgstr ""
"%(employee)s no està d'acord amb un canvi que l'empresa proposa al seu\n"
"registre de jornada, del dia %(day)s."

# revisar: traducido sin hablante nativo el 2026-08-27
#: templates/emails/representatives_informed.txt:8
msgid ""
"Art. 4.b of the working-time record decree requires that you be informed\n"
"when this happens. The company may still apply the change, and if it does, "
"the\n"
"record will show it was made without agreement, with their account beside "
"it.\n"
"\n"
"What they wrote is not reproduced here. Art. 6.2 grants you access to the\n"
"register, so you can consult the entry and its history in the application."
msgstr ""
"L'art. 4.b del decret del registre de jornada exigeix que se us informi\n"
"quan això passa. L'empresa encara pot aplicar el canvi, i si ho fa, el "
"registre\n"
"mostrarà que es va fer sense acord, amb la versió de la persona al costat.\n"
"\n"
"Aquí no es reprodueix el que va escriure. L'art. 6.2 us dóna accés al\n"
"registre, així que podeu consultar l'assentament i el seu historial a "
"l'aplicació."
